flowchart TD
  query[A query]
  hybrid[Hybrid search]
  literal[Literal and regex scan]
  inverted[Inverted line-key scan]
  multisect[Multisect scan]
  scopes[Scope matches]
  idf[IDF and density rerank]
  callers[Callers]
  callees[Callees]
  result[Result]

  query -->|literal and regex, CLI and MCP| literal
  query -->|search flag| hybrid
  hybrid -->|literal path| literal
  query -->|fast, and GUI regex| inverted
  query -->|multi-term| multisect
  query -->|callers| callers
  query -->|callees| callees
  callers -->|scans keys for call patterns| inverted
  callees -->|reads the function body| result
  multisect -->|two phases| scopes
  scopes -->|CLI and GUI| idf
  scopes -->|MCP, no rerank| result
  idf -->|ranked scopes| result
  literal -->|unscored, file order| result
  inverted -->|unscored, skips common lines| result

%% tip: Inverted line-key scan :: Tests every stored line against the pattern. Lines in more than 50 files were never stored.
%% tip: Multisect scan :: Scans file lines directly. It does not use the inverted index.
%% tip: IDF and density rerank :: Only multisect results are ranked; literal and inverted results carry a score of 0.
